cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, cite the release you used and preserve the
  attribution to Muhammad Muqeet and the upstream source owners.
title: Large Anime Text Dataset
version: 2.1.0
abstract: >-
  A text-only anime corpus of 35,766 works and 2.44M structured rows for LLM
  fine-tuning, instruction tuning, RAG, question answering, entity linking and
  recommendation. Every row carries provenance, confidence, split and a
  redistribution tier. The full mixed-rights release is gated with manual
  approval; a free 30% preview is gated with automatic approval; a 969-work
  CC0-only subset is public.
authors:
